SPRING JPA :

App -> JPA[interface] -> Hibernate[implementation] -> JDBC -> DB Drive -> Relation DB [SQL]

ORM Framework : JPA[interface] -> Hibernate[implementation]

JDBC without SB:
	- make connection with DB
	- query db nd process result
	- sActual impl is provided by specific DB drivers
	- create a connection class A - loads drivers - getConnection() - preparedStatement - Callable Statement [for procedure]
	- disadvantage :
		- closing db connection 
		- memory leak 
		- need to hanlde exception
		
JDBC with SB:
	- no need to open/close connection
	- starter jdbc dependcy
	- sql - drive dependcy
	- reduce boiler plant code
	- jdbcTemplate.execut/upadte :
	- dataSource manage connection pool
	- whn app start  DriveManage class is started
	- whn we run .query it will connect new connection or takes from pool no need for manual connection
	- closing also handle by jdbc
	- default - hikari database used min / max of 10 is used if we need to change then change in app.properities
	
ORM : Object-Relational-Mapping
	- works as a bridge between Java Obj to SQL query
	- works with Object, no sql needed
	- ORM uses Hibernate implement
	- dep : spring-boot-data-jpa - which have hibernate also
	- db properties need to be addes in app.properties file
	- need to creATE a Entity Class
	- @Id
	- @GeneratedValue(stratrgy = GenerationTyoe.IDENTITY)
	- need to extends the JpaRepository by Repository
	- own query used in Repository
	- Contoller -> Service -> Repo -> DB
	- .getALL .save .findAll
	- to debug wht query is runnning:
		- spring.jpa.show-sql = true
		- spring.jpa.properities.hibernate.format_sql = true
		
JPA Architeure:
	1.Persisitence Unit : Configuration - App.Properties
		- DB connection , dialect , driver 
		
	2.EntityManagerFactory
		- for one Persisitence unit one Java Object EntityManagerFactory is created
		- equal no of EntityManagerFactory will create for Persisitence Unit
		- each EntityManagerFactory will have transactionsmanager
		
	3.Entity Manager 
		- is a session in SpringBoot
		- JpaRepository internally connect Entity Manager it have save() findall() findbyid ()
		- session impl class is used for query - Entity Manager  obj is required
		- insert update delete are interally annotatited with transactional 
		
